// D&D's Shillelagh lets the caster's weapon strikes use spellcasting power
// instead of raw muscle and hit harder -- modeled with the existing Reckless
// buff (attack-damage increase), the same "weapon damage bonus (modeled as
// Reckless interim)" pattern already shipped in hemomancy/bloodbound_edge.ron.
// Reckless's paired vulnerability increase isn't in the sheet's description but
// is Reckless's only shape in this engine; flagged as a deviation, not a silent
// reinterpretation.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: Reckless, data: BuffData(strength: 0.15, duration: Some(60.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 20,
    meta: (school: Some(Transmutation), source: Some(Primordial)),
)
